### 1. POST /api/lots — créer un lot (nominal, complet) — MAGASINIER_PNA réceptionne un nouveau lot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lots
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroLot": "PARA-TEST-{{$timestamp}}",
  "medicamentId": "{{medicamentParacetamolId}}",
  "fournisseurId": "{{fournisseurPharmaSenegalId}}",
  "dateFabrication": "2026-01-15",
  "dateExpiration": "2027-06-30",
  "prixAchat": 18.50,
  "prixVente": 25.00
}


### 2. POST /api/lots — cas limite, champs optionnels absents (dateFabrication, prix)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lots
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroLot": "SIROP-TEST-{{$timestamp}}",
  "medicamentId": "{{medicamentSiropId}}",
  "fournisseurId": "{{fournisseurMedSupplyId}}",
  "dateExpiration": "2027-01-01"
}


### 3. POST /api/lots — cas d'erreur, dateExpiration manquante (400 attendu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lots
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroLot": "LOT-SANS-EXPIRATION-{{$timestamp}}",
  "medicamentId": "{{medicamentParacetamolId}}",
  "fournisseurId": "{{fournisseurPharmaSenegalId}}"
}


### 4. POST /api/lots — cas d'erreur, numeroLot vide (400 attendu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lots
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numeroLot": "",
  "medicamentId": "{{medicamentParacetamolId}}",
  "fournisseurId": "{{fournisseurPharmaSenegalId}}",
  "dateExpiration": "2027-01-01"
}


